  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-011",
    "title": "旧驿道"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_061",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "灰布弟子回头，抓起柜台上的油纸包。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "封山令持续到第七日。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1542,
          "end": 1542
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这七日里，玄霄宗恢复了表面上的秩序。外门弟子照常修炼、吃饭、巡灯，西坡却始终挂着黑色封条。每到夜里，山门九盏灯便有一盏无故摇晃，第二天仍有人把它解释成山风。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1544,
          "end": 1544
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有再去废井。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1546,
          "end": 1546
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他把半截灯杆藏在床板下，将没有灯芯的小灯盏包进油布，藏在衣箱夹层。掌心残印时隐时现，除了偶尔带来寒意，并未让他的修为增长。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1548,
          "end": 1548
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "真正变化的是他的记忆。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1550,
          "end": 1550
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他想不起北河城那棵老槐树的树冠，也想不起父亲最后一次出门时穿的是什么颜色的衣服。那些细节并不妨碍生活，却像屋里被搬走的家具，留下一个轮廓分明的空处。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1552,
          "end": 1552
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第七日清晨，沈砚秋把他叫到登记堂。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1554,
          "end": 1554
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三盏长明灯中，最左边那盏终于恢复了与另外两盏相同的高度。灯芯却换过，底座也留下新鲜的焊痕。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1556,
          "end": 1556
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封山令午时解除。”她说，“你可以留在听雨院，参加下月的外门考核。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1558,
          "end": 1558
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“也可以离开？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1560,
          "end": 1560
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可以。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1562,
          "end": 1562
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“离开后还能回来吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1564,
          "end": 1564
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“若没有新的禁令。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1566,
          "end": 1566
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋把一份薄薄的卷宗推给他。卷宗封皮写着“西坡旧阵”，里面只有四页，前三页记载维修，第四页是一张旧驿道地图。地图上从玄霄宗到山脚画着一条废弃水道，水道尽头标着两个字：无灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1568,
          "end": 1568
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是你答应给我的旧档？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1570,
          "end": 1570
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是。旧档没有这张图。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1572,
          "end": 1572
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那它从哪里来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1574,
          "end": 1574
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有人把它放在我的案头。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1576,
          "end": 1576
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“叶观澜？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1578,
          "end": 1578
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有承认，也没有否认：“无灯镇不属于玄霄宗辖地。你若去那里，宗门不会保护你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1580,
          "end": 1580
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我父亲去过那里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1582,
          "end": 1582
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你只知道他曾经被记录在西坡。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1584,
          "end": 1584
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“现在我知道三个人在无灯镇未归。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1586,
          "end": 1586
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她看着他，语气很轻：“知道得越多，能回头的路越少。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1588,
          "end": 1588
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临收起地图：“我想知道剩下两个人是谁。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1590,
          "end": 1590
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有阻拦。她从桌下取出一盏普通引路灯，递给他。灯芯完整，灯油清亮，灯罩内壁却刻着一道极浅的缺口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1592,
          "end": 1592
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“带上它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1594,
          "end": 1594
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗的灯？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1596,
          "end": 1596
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“路上若有人问，就说是我准许你带走的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1598,
          "end": 1598
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果没人问呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1600,
          "end": 1600
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就别点。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1602,
          "end": 1602
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把灯收进包中。他正要离开，沈砚秋忽然叫住他：“陆沉舟不是叛徒。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1604,
          "end": 1604
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这是她第一次替这个名字作出判断。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1606,
          "end": 1606
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“昨晚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1632,
          "end": 1632
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁告诉你的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1634,
          "end": 1634
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“档房那个老者。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1636,
          "end": 1636
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想起那双浑浊却清醒的眼睛。老者说过，档案若少了，就当它从来没有在这里。可他显然记得每一张被拿走的纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1638,
          "end": 1638
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "午时，山门铁闸升起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1640,
          "end": 1640
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "大多数弟子留在宗内，只有几名外门修士带着任务下山。陆照临和顾长离没有走正门，而是沿渡桥下的旧水道前行。水道入口藏在一块坍塌石碑后，石壁上刻着送灯人的旧规矩：入水道者，不得回头数灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1642,
          "end": 1642
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "水道比想象中狭窄。两人只能侧身通行，脚下积水没过鞋底。每隔一段距离，石壁上便有一个凹槽，凹槽里原本应该放灯，如今只剩焦黑的痕迹。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1644,
          "end": 1644
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别数。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1648,
          "end": 1648
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让它自己走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1658,
          "end": 1658
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "两人立即熄灭手里的小灯，退到旧灯具后。马蹄在驿站外停下，随后有人跳下马。来人没有敲门，先绕屋走了一圈，靴底踩过门前的苔藓。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1791,
          "end": 1791
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“里面有人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1793,
          "end": 1793
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "声音年轻而冷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1795,
          "end": 1795
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把铜针夹在指间。陆照临握住短刀，掌心残印微微发热。门外的人推门而入，穿一身灰布短褂，腰间挂着玄霄宗的制式令牌。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1797,
          "end": 1797
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“戒律堂搜查。”那人说，“有人携带宗门禁物下山，见到可疑者，立即报信。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1799,
          "end": 1799
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他举起一张画像。画像上的脸被墨涂黑，只留下姓名：陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1801,
          "end": 1801
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临屏住呼吸。灰布弟子在屋里走了一圈，手指在柜台木板上停住。他看见“陆沉”两个字，低声道：“又是这一笔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1803,
          "end": 1803
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“师兄知道这是谁？”旁边的人问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1805,
          "end": 1805
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不知道。三年前每座驿站都有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1807,
          "end": 1807
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么后来没有了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1809,
          "end": 1809
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为有人把路封了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1811,
          "end": 1811
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "两人正要往后墙走，屋外忽然传来一声犬吠。灰布弟子回头，抓起柜台上的油纸包。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1813,
          "end": 1813
        }
      }
    ],
